{"id": "84160671-0125-4f3b-b2b9-551b72ec351c", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T10:20:49.777257", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "d6a43aa3-697c-48ec-afe8-58e46365b40c", "thought": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "The workspace is essentially bare — here is what I found before proposing anything."}], "reasoning_content": "Confirmation: The workspace is empty except for task.json. There's no SPAG code, no game environment, no checkpoints, no evaluation harness, and no datasets. Python 3.14.4 is available, torch is not installed, no GPU driver access, no network (no DNS). pip packages are only system utilities (ansible, etc.).

